# quantum-local-fixer

> Local fixer shelf with a quantum-themed name. Sister idea to control-.

## Purpose
Give a plain-language door to fitzyracing1/quantum-local-fixer.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the original repo as the place for fixer files.
2. Use this clone to explain the idea.
3. Send the reader back to the source.

## Key ideas
- Local fixer
- Quantum-themed name
- HTML snapshot

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/quantum-local-fixer
open_source()
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. open_source() → “go to the local fixer repo”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader wants the TS scanner → control-
- If a reader wants this shelf → stay on the source

## What a person would notice
A named wrap on a local-fixer door.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the source.
